guide forever/professions/first-aid
title First Aid 1-300
category Professions
levels 5-60
zone Azeroth

# First Aid makes bandages from the cloth that drops while you level, and in Forever its trainers
# also teach healing potions. It takes no profession slot, so any character can level it beside two
# others. Bandages need no fire or station: craft them anywhere.
#
# Ranks: Apprentice and Journeyman at any level from any First Aid trainer; Expert from the book
# Expert First Aid - Under Wraps (First Aid 125, no character level), sold by Deneb Walker in the
# Arathi Highlands and Balai Lok'Wein in Dustwallow Marsh; Artisan from the Triage quest (First Aid
# 225, level 35) at the doctor in Theramore or Hammerfall, who also teaches the last three bandages.
#
# The route (crafts are about what it takes; yellow and green recipes can take a few more):
# Apprentice (1-75), from level 1:
#    1-40  50 Linen Bandage: 50 Linen Cloth
#   40-75  47 Heavy Linen Bandage: 94 Linen Cloth
# Journeyman (75-150), from level 1:
#   75-80  13 Heavy Linen Bandage: 26 Linen Cloth
#   80-115 52 Wool Bandage: 52 Wool Cloth
#  115-150 51 Heavy Wool Bandage: 102 Wool Cloth
# Expert (150-225), from level 1:
#  150-180 44 Silk Bandage: 44 Silk Cloth
#  180-210 44 Heavy Silk Bandage: 88 Silk Cloth
#  210-225 19 Mageweave Bandage: 19 Mageweave Cloth
# Artisan (225-300), from level 35:
#  225-240 26 Mageweave Bandage: 26 Mageweave Cloth
#  240-260 30 Heavy Mageweave Bandage: 60 Mageweave Cloth
#  260-290 47 Runecloth Bandage: 47 Runecloth
#  290-300 12 Heavy Runecloth Bandage: 24 Runecloth

